      "repo": [
        "Body facts in the caliper-docgen-core extractor were owned by extent or classification order; the fix owns them by exact node and orders them by source position.",
        "For wrapper functions, ownership is the unwrapped function node, so JSX in a wrapper's other arguments (e.g. `<Icon />` in withOptions options) now reaches file usages.",
